# ============================================================
#  PAYMENT RECEIPTS — no direct web access
#
#  GCash/Maya screenshots attached to document requests. Same
#  exposure the other upload directories already closed: Apache
#  happily serves anything under htdocs, so a receipt was readable
#  by anyone who guessed the 8-hex suffix — no login, no
#  session, and no record of who looked. A receipt carries a
#  transaction reference and a real name, so that is a payment
#  detail and a personal detail leaking together.
#
#  Downloaded through api/file-download.php after an
#  authorisation check (owner, or registrar desk).
# ============================================================
Require all denied